Z||000008||AusFiero||07-30-2001||01:24 PM||||Ok I am now an official MOMO distributor. The above wheels I can sell for US$215 for the wheel only if you wish to use a MOMO Boss Kit bought locally in the USA. If you want one with an adaptor plate to bolt it onto a Fiero GT wheel exisiting boss kit the cost is $250. The price includes delivery to the USA or Canada and it is fully insured also. Canadians will cop charges from their own government for GST,  PST and a few other charges. <P>I can now supply any MOMO product so until I get things online at <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>www.auto-alley.com</A>  (down for maintainance at present) just email me direct.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||14
